        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Yayo! O anyana adikaŋa, akwataŋa mpùŋa jakadiami, abutaŋa nachifwiku chakubula kutambula kudi spiritu yami, kulonda akalunjiki nshidi hanshidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akunkumukaŋa muEjipitu chakubula kwihula kukanwa kamami; adikoleshaŋa naŋovu yaFwaro, akuhwelelaŋa wulelu waEjipitu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Ŋovu yaFwaro akayikoolesha nsonyi, chimukuku hwelelawulelu waEjipitu chakayibayisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tulamba twinditudi kuZowani, tupanda twindi tunenzi kuHanesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu akatiya nsonyi yawantu akadi kumwenamu chuma, abulaŋa kukwasha, hela kuwahishamuntu, kwansonyi hohu, nikusawuka nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wakutena anyama akukabeta kakuchidiilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaku dinu wakachisoneki kumesu awu hachuma chakusoneka, wakachisoneki nawa nimumukanda, kulonda chakekali chanyaka yakukuminina chahaya nyaka nanyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hiyantu adikaŋa, hiyanyana atwambatwambaŋa, hiyanyana alekaŋa kutiya munshimbi jaYehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayilaŋa akwakumona nawu, Bayi mumonaŋaku; ayilaŋa atuprofwetu nawu, Bayi namutuprofwetelaŋa yuma yaloŋa aku, tuhoshelenuŋa yuma yaselumuka, profwetenu yakudimbana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fumenu munjila, baalukenu munjila, mulekeshenu Wajila waIsarela kumwekana kumesu etu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Wajila waIsarela nindi, Ichi chimu kudi wula izu idi, himukukuhwelela niikabisha, nikuluwalala, himukushindamenahu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi kuluwa iku kwakayibalumukila neyi mbaŋu yikukeŋa kuhumuka yikunduki, neyi mbaŋu yayilehi yikunana yikuhumuka chakukasumwisha katata kamu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayihumuna neyi chahumunaŋawu inuŋu yakaŋemi, kuyihumuna pwashi pwashi chakadi nikwanakena; chakukaŋanya kuwana chizanda chakwokwela kesi hejiku, hela chakutaha nachu meji kwishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Nzambi, Wajila waIsarela, nindi, Enu kwamwinewa chiŋa kufunta nakuduŋumika; Ŋovu jenu yowu kudi wunjika zo-o nakukuhwelela; enu kwenukwonti kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu nenu, Nehi, twakatemukila hatuwalu. Dichi mwakatemukachi. Nenu, Twakendela hatunyama twasweja lufuchi. Dichi antu akayihaŋa akasweja lufuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kombakaji dawantu akatemuka kuhosha kwakuyihoshola kudi muntu wumu, mwakatemuka kuhosha kwakuyihoshola kudi antu atanu; nichimwakashala neyi mutondu wakushimikahewulu dampidi lwi-i, neyi mpandelu yahampidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chakachiŋililayi Yehova, kulonda akayitiyili luwi; dichi chakaditwalilayi kwiwulu, kulonda akayitiyili wushona; muloŋa Yehova hiNzambi wawupaji; antu ejima akumu chiŋilila yena anako oleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa antu akashakama muZiyona kuYerusalema. Hiwakadilanawa cheŋuku. Chiwakakaluka muteti wakakutiyila luwi; chakatiyayi, wakakwakula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela neyi Mwanta wukuyinka kudya kwalukadi nakuyinwishameji amakabi, hela chochu, akwakuyileja hiyakaswamana nawacheŋuku, mwakamona akwakuyileja namesu enu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chimwakabalumukila kuchikasa chachidiilu, nichimwaka balumukila kuchikasa chachimunswa, mwakatiya namatu enu izu kunyima yenu nawu, Njila iyi, endenu mwomwenimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakajilola yuma yimwashasha hadi akishi enu akusoŋa siliva, niyimwalamika lamika hadi akishi enu akusupununa awuru; mwakayinata neyi chanatapawu chuma chamajilu; mwakachila nenu, Fumakuku kweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakakwinka nvula yambutu jeyi jiwakatumba heseki; niyakudyayikusoŋa aheseki yakekala yamanji yakasweja nikuvula. Dena ifuku oduyimuna yenu yakadiila mumawudiilu amaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niaŋombi nianyanakawayimbulu adimaŋa heseki akadya yakudya yamuŋawa, yakupepa hafwosholu nahalwalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hewulu dampidi jajilehi jejima, nihampidi janyuŋa jejima, hakekala tuloŋa natuseloki twameji, hefuku dakusweja kujahana, hakakundoka tuposhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela mweji wakekala neyi mwaana, mwaana wakabadikamu mapampa katanu nakayedi, neyi mwaana wamafuku atanu nayedi, hefuku dakakasayi Yehova hayikatu yawantu indi, hakakuswishayi yitu yawu yayeteluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, ijina daYehova hidikwinza, hidikufuma kwakulehi, didi nakubidimakesi kakuzuwa kwindi, didi nakukakumuka wishi wadita; kunyivumbu yindi kwandombu hohu, idimi dindi hikesi kanopeshaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muuya windi wudi neyi kaloŋa kadi nakusumpuka kashika nimunshiŋu, kulondakusala nyuza namusalu wakujilumuka; kulonda chikuŋu chamukanwa chidi nakuluwisha chakekali muyibapa yanyuza yawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakemba kaminakadi neyi kembaŋawu nawufuku wakudya chawija chajila; mwakatiyakuwaha kunyichima, neyi muntu wudi nakuya nakwimba mahululu, hakuyakumpidi yaYehova, kwilola daIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakatiyakesha kulemakwezu dindi; wakamwekesha chakatwalayi chikasa chindi kwishina nandombuyakuzuwa kwindi, nimulapu wakesi kanoŋeshaŋa, nampepela yasweja Ŋovu, ninvula yeneni nankashi, ninvula yamalola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
