              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwejima mwaka mwetelayi Yehova mutondu wamufuukwilayi dehi, chakekala ikuadi nakwimba ndimba natudada; wakalwa nawu namajita akukankisha.",
